  "text": "Gold Price in the 2010s\nBetween the first (2010-01-29) and last (2019-12-30) monthly observations available for the 2010s, the LBMA gold price went from $1,079 to $1,515 — a gain of 40% — with a sampled high of $1,814 (Aug 2011) and a sampled low of $1,060 (Dec 2015).\nYears in the 2010s\n2010\n2011\n2012\n2013\n2014\n2015\n2016\n2017\n2018\n2019\nSee today's live gold price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop gold bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
